(1) Single-stage planning 
Using a 13-node system, in order to visually compare the impact of new energy and 
data center DC loads on the overall distribution network morphology and structure after 
penetration into the distribution network, this paper designs two future distribution net-
work operation scenario time sections for comparative analysis. 
Scenario 1: Contains distributed PV and WT, DC loads and AC loads in a data center. 
Scenario 2: Contains distri buted PV and WT, and contains only AC loads (the DC 
loads of Scenario 1 are superimposed on the AC loads). 
